  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Golden Hour — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have begun to master your technique. You have learned to use your technique for longer. As an action for 4 cursed energy instead of stopping time you can empower yourself for longer, gaining the following benefits for 1 minute: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Your speed is doubled.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You gain a +3 bonus to AC.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You have advantage on Dexterity saving throws.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You gain an additional action on each of its turns. That action can be used only to take the Attack (one weapon attack only), Dash, Disengage, Hide, or Use an Object action.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You cannot stop time until this feature ends.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
